Z||000005||Rodrv6||08-31-2000||02:04 PM||||My 84 originally had the dipstick in front of the valve cover on the right side of the engine.  After one of the recalls it came back relocated on the left side of the engine near the thermostat housing.  I guess it was one of those "design improvements".<P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  84 SE||||reg||1
